      <tr class="is-modified"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">cli</span> crates/engine-cli/src/cli.rs</summary><div class="pl-card">Every short-help line over 80 columns under -h is shortened by one rule (47 lines on 10 surfaces at HEAD 89fe959), and two possible-value lists move to the long help. resume --json states that the extension is replaced by .jsonl.</div></details></td><td>modified</td><td>crates/engine-cli/src</td><td>+22 / -10</td></tr>
      <tr class="is-modified"><td><details><summary><span class="pl-chip">test</span> crates/engine-cli/tests/cli_args.rs</summary><div class="pl-card">The 80-column test reads -h and --help on all 10 help surfaces (20 checks). New regression tests cover the dump path, one OS-error mention, and no escape byte on redirected stderr. After Q-2: failure-record tests validated against the record schemas.</div></details></td><td>modified</td><td>crates/engine-cli/tests</td><td>+120 / -8</td></tr>
